          "label": "m in the result of lens 0.0->1.0 is an integer computed by v0_0.n + 1, in [-inf, +inf], which the checker cannot show within int64 and the target's int32; bound the fields it reads (int32, >=0 & <=100)"
        },
        {
          "label": "a lens must be total: every instance of schema 0.0 must translate to an instance of schema 1.0 (totality rule unknown-bounds)"
        }
